 y. Default time: 6:30 PM, Monday to Friday (monthly and seasonal tasks sit
  inside that block at 6:35 PM). Move it to any time that suits you: open a
 n event, tap Edit, change the time, then choose 'Save for Future Events' (
 iPhone) or 'This and following events' (Google). Safety: test any hack on 
 a small hidden spot first, never mix bleach with vinegar or ammonia, and k
 eep vinegar and lemon off natural stone. Full safety notes are on page 3 o
 f your guide. CelestialPrintCanada
