DESCRIPTION:5-min Daily Reset: dishes in the dishwasher (or a quick wash)
 \, wipe the kitchen counters and stovetop\, 2-minute pick-up (anything on 
 the floor or couch goes back)\, quick swipe of the bathroom sink\, trash o
 ut if it's full\, start a laundry load if the basket's full.\n\nThen 10-15
  min KITCHEN (pick what fits): Wipe cabinet fronts and handles. Clean the 
 microwave (lemon steam\, Hack 6). Wipe the sink and faucet. Wipe appliance
  fronts (Hack 14). Shake out the mat. Toss old leftovers.\n\nSet a timer. 
 When it rings\, stop. Done enough is done.\n\nDefault time: 6:30 PM\, Mond
 ay to Friday (monthly and seasonal tasks sit inside that block at 6:35 PM)
 . Move it to any time that suits you: open an event\, tap Edit\, change th
 e time\, then choose 'Save for Future Events' (iPhone) or 'This and follow
 ing events' (Google). Safety: test any hack on a small hidden spot first\,
  never mix bleach with vinegar or ammonia\, and keep vinegar and lemon off
  natural stone. Full safety notes are on page 3 of your guide. CelestialPr
 intCanada
